  "ja320:1.1": "Succajaṃ vata na-ccaji ",
  "ja320:1.2": "vācāya adadaṃ giriṃ, ",
  "ja320:1.3": "kiṃ hi tass' acajantassa ",
  "ja320:1.4": "vācāya adada pabbatanti. ",
  "ja320:2.1": "",
  "ja320:2.2": "Yaṃ hi kayirā taṃ hi vade yan na kayirā na taṃ vade, ",
  "ja320:2.3": "akarontaṃ bhāsamānaṃ ",
  "ja320:2.4": "parijānanti paṇḍitāti. ",
  "ja320:3.1": "Rājaputta namo ty-atthu, ",
  "ja320:3.2": "sacce dhamme ṭhito c' asi ",
  "ja320:3.3": "yassa te vyasanam patto ",
  "ja320:3.4": "saccasmiṃ ramate manoti. ",
  "ja320:4.1": "Yā daḷiddī daḷiddassa ",
  "ja320:4.2": "aḍḍhā aḍḍhassa kittimā ",
  "ja320:4.3": "sā hi 'ssa paramā bhariyā, ",
  "ja320:4.4": "tā hi raññassa itthiyoti. ",
